    "body": "## Problem\n\nWith 'linebreak' and extmark-conceal, `win_line()` reads the line to collect conceal spans, also when it only draws virt_lines below the last line. That line does not exist: \"E315: ml_get: Invalid lnum\". Regression from #42370.\n\n## Solution\n\nCollect conceal spans only when the line text is drawn (`draw_text`).\n",
